        "collapsible_row_BVLGr7": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "UPS",
            "icon": "plant",
            "row_content": "<p>We utilize cardboard and paper packing materials for all of our shipping boxes. Our boxes are secured using an eco friendly paper tape.</p><p>When possible, we use  our own, in-house recycled cardboard as packing material.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_JEm9hK": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "XPO/ Freight",
            "icon": "plant",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Pallet wrap</strong>:<br/>You'll find some of your pallet items are pallet-wrapped to keep them secure and clean during transit. Good news: this wrap is industrially biodegradable and won't leave behind microplastics! After unpacking, please help us complete the cycle by sending the used wrap back with your next Close The Loop return.<br/></p><p><strong>Ratchet Straps</strong>:<br/>Our ratchet straps are reusable and can be purchased for ongoing use with our Close The Loop system. To ensure your straps are returned to you specifically, please mark them with your name using a marker or paint pen after you receive your order. This will help us avoid confusion with the straps from our other Close The Loop participants. Ratchet straps are used with barrels only!<br/></p><p><strong>Gaylord boxes</strong>:<br/>Gaylord boxes are available for purchase as an alternative to pallet wrapping. They are ideal for items unsuitable for ratchet straps, such as eco jugs, buckets, bag-in-box, and miscellaneous items. Please note:  barrels cannot be placed inside these boxes. For example, an order of three barrels and twelve eco jugs would require two separate pallets. If you purchase a Gaylord box, the eco jugs will be placed inside it.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
